Attribution

VecEval accompanies *FleetAgent: Teleoperation Assistant for Autonomous Fleets via Vectorized V2N Messages*, by Juntong Peng, Qi Chen, Deyuan Qu, Takayuki Shimizu, Yaobin Chen and Ziran Wang. Author affiliations and the internship attribution appear in README.md.

Underlying data: *nuScenes: A multimodal dataset for autonomous driving*, Holger Caesar, Varun Bankiti, Alex H. Lang, Sourabh Vora, Venice Erin Liong, Qiang Xu, Anush Krishnan, Yu Pan, Giancarlo Baldan and Oscar Beijbom, CVPR 2020. The nuScenes providers retain their applicable rights and notices.

VecEval adds candidate-plan language annotations. Subsequent review corrected supported annotation errors and aligned analysis with vector coordinates and timing. The JSON files retain plan IDs, planning coordinates, sample tokens and all five annotation fields. No endorsement by the nuScenes providers is asserted.
